cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, cite it as below."
title: "doc-translate-keep-layout: document translation that keeps layout, with a fail-closed pre-flight gate"
abstract: >-
  Translates .docx and .pptx files by replacing text nodes only, leaving runs,
  fonts, sizes and table structure intact, and refuses to proceed when structure,
  terminology or input integrity cannot be established. Ships a terminology
  consistency table, a bidirectional layout review, per-run aligned fill for
  mixed-format paragraphs, and a SHA-256 audit record for every run. Zero
  third-party dependencies.
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhao"
    given-names: "Xinghua"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-0512-1237"
version: "0.5.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/stevenzhao07/doc-translate-keep-layout"
keywords:
  - document translation
  - docx
  - pptx
  - layout preservation
  - terminology consistency
  - audit trail
  - medical device documentation
